%% @title A wrong code sends you back to retry, up to three times
%% @subtitle Today's sign-in with a one-time code. No status colours: this is current behaviour.
flowchart LR
  start([Open app]) --> email[Enter email]
  email --> send[Send code]
  send --> code[Enter code]
  code --> check{Code correct?}
  check -->|yes| home([Signed in])
  check -->|no| tries{Tries left?}
  tries -->|yes| code
  tries -->|no| locked([Locked 15 min])
